{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52292","headline":"诗（幷序） 五十三 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 五十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雷发南山上，雨落北浮（张改作「泽」，戴校「海」，项校「溪」）中。\n雷惊{石擘}礰（张改作「霹雳」）火，雨激咆哮风。\n倏忽威灵歇，须臾势乃穷。\n天地不能以，如女爲身空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52292.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52292","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}